WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.479
Hi! I'm Mia. Let's talk about the seasons!

2
00:00:04.929 --> 00:00:09.713
This is winter. It's cold! In winter, I drink hot chocolate.

3
00:00:11.963 --> 00:00:16.421
This is spring. I love the flowers! My birthday is in September.

4
00:00:18.671 --> 00:00:24.104
This is summer, my favorite season! Why? Because I love the beach.

5
00:00:26.354 --> 00:00:28.165
And this is autumn, or fall.

6
00:00:28.615 --> 00:00:32.981
My favorite day of the week is Saturday, because I go to the beach with my friends.

7
00:00:35.231 --> 00:00:38.528
And you? What's your favorite season? Why?

